OL,3,GNEWSACyber criminal orchestrated #2m
OL,4,Acrypto theft bid from jail cell
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "sophisticated cybercriminal" who
OL,7,Forchestrated an attempted #2m
OL,8,Fcryptocurrency theft from his prison
OL,9,Fcell has been jailed for eight years.
OL,11,FRobert Barr, 29, ordered Sean Favier,
OL,12,F26, and Iain Doyle, 37, to steal
OL,13,Fdigital assets from two homes in
OL,14,FMidlothian while he was a prisoner at
OL,15,FHMP Edinburgh.
OL,17,FBut the plan was foiled during the
OL,18,Fsecond theft, when Favier and Doyle
OL,19,Frealised they had been caught on a
OL,20,Fdoorbell camera.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
